# ============================================================
# BDC IMS — Tests: No Direct Web Access
# IMS-Frontend/tests/.htaccess
# The SFTP watcher does not upload tests/, but the deploy never deletes either,
# so a copy that reached the server once stays there. The root .htaccess blocks
# .md/.txt/.map/.sql/.log but not .js, which would leave these served.
# ============================================================

Options -Indexes -MultiViews

Order Deny,Allow
Deny from all
